果。\n\t\t这一法术有 25%% 的几率触发风暴之怒。\n\t\t技能伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9a0bacbad99eb7e17f1ef222a875af436ee09d61b14eb46a01ccc4adbeac5f97","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"8625bbbfd5a92bb1a58d5c0479e7f44b2cfb9b8e4116646192d062a0ee13546c","logical_entry_identity":"47eb769a75f52c420bd2f86566275db76012e96b00ce55bf6ef27569f534202a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Tinkerer's Twinblaster","source_tag":"entity name","target":"工程师的双重爆破"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ab321bdc481ee5a5b75b373ea073dccc95ae8a912bd9d4396290ed2a9ceb27d6","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"863342613733a67a0995a8cf07aad674331060fc5eed7913d86c3ae4f6e67c62","logical_entry_identity":"3607d3f4486679f53d6210a90a3b4885b44be6ddbece15bd0ffadf1de68dec7e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Allows you to have a steam pool. Steam is used to use most steamtech equipments and powers.","source_tag":"_t","target":"让你有一个蒸汽池。蒸汽用于大多数蒸汽技术装备和能力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"51c8f13fe783eb843bdcffd8d68cf0a70747c7bbda09a03975fb5aac9317eaae","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"864b7487d2ece58d54c7eb85eb83b340ccaaeee9461b6aab72af32d22a9fe919","logical_entry_identity":"ccecbfca0c0efe7d763c6ac86e9e5437ddfa8dc13260b36ca3280c42e1c4a9a0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Freedom! Let's rally to Kruk Pride!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们自由了！冲向克鲁克部落！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"12422f93a15f3c85569b875a2afe1ae232099a9c65bd71b12656a42d385dc6ce","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"8659ce4c310c8c08d8bbc2485ca45f061aa873e7fe9509b6d919d6d6c683f407","logical_entry_identity":"d11f43d862bebdf76f0db83bb7126872bca5bf51617da4a846b5674167969cb5","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"An oversized white ant. It seems not yet fully developed.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一只超大的白色蚂蚁。它似乎还没有完全发展。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7a04126736fba0ae323ad51ab84ff561bd31a931ac77cb45bcb00ed9f5ffb85f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_ide